[[File:Amer.png|thumb|250px|Amer]]
(Japanese: '''アメール''' ''Amer'') is a [[Pokémon hunter]] and [[character of the day]] who appeared in [[BWS01]] as its main antagonist.

While {{an|Cilan}} went fishing with his {{TP|Cilan|Pansage}}, Amer threw a {{p|Qwilfish}}-shaped bomb in the lake where Cilan was. This caused problems for the {{p|Gyarados}} there as the bomb released electricity onto Gyarados that harmed it and caused it to use attacks uncontrollably. Later, Amer picked up the Qwilfish-shaped bomb after adjusting the controls on the device. Cilan took out his fishing rod and used it to hook the Gyarados in which a net was fired at it.

After Cilan witnessed the real cause behind Gyarados's rage, Amer caught up with him and [[Officer Jenny]]. As Amer continued to use the bomb to injure Gyarados, this backfired as Gyarados's {{m|Hyper Beam}} partially destroyed it. Gyarados's {{m|Flamethrower}} destroyed Amer's boat but Cilan had {{TP|Cilan|Crustle}} prevent him from escaping. With the Gyarados calmed, Amer's plans were stopped.

